-- SIDEBAR NAV + PAGES
-- BigFroot sidebar: a group header ("Main"), then its tabs as rows. The selected row shows the accent bar on
-- the far left and accent-tinted icon/text. Each tab owns one scrolling page of two groupbox columns.
-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
local Category = {}
Category.__index = Category
local Tab = {}
Tab.__index = Tab

-- lucide icon per category/tab name, so a hub gets the right glyph without passing one
local NAV_ICONS = {
